,"name":"Sun TV","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wkyNhgg9DDtQMFBGXpAaHilE99N.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1059905,"name":"Naozumi Takahashi","role":"Rui Aiba (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3h8P7TDjXhnnvd8RhXsqffW9tsR.jpg"},{"id":1613352,"name":"Toshiki Masuda","role":"Atom Kirihara (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oMAk5Pu3aazmwFwiVOgyU7iW5ut.jpg"},{"id":1243881,"name":"KENN","role":"L Nomura (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y7Gtn1PchXJ1MxmUxU9jtt138EO.jpg"},{"id":1781816,"name":"Yuuto Suzuki","role":"R Nomura (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cLOM19i1I5TCLD6PpmIiuUU1uQ0.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"MARGINAL #4 the Animation","overview":"Il 13 febbraio, mentre i fiocchi di neve danzano nell'aria, alla Pythagoras Production nasce un nuovo gruppo di idol che porterà  i loro baci ai confini della galassia: i Marginal #4. Atom Kirihara, Rui Aiba, L Nomura e R Nomura concentrano i loro sforzi nella loro carriera per la gioia delle fan! Continuano a maturare come idol assieme al gruppo più anziano che domina la scena dell'intrattenimento, Lagrange Point, e quello più giovane che prepara il proprio debutto, Unicorn Jr. Quando scendono dal palco, però, sono normali studenti delle superiori con una caotica vita scolastica!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Marginal#4 Kiss Kara Tsukuru Big Bang","overview":"On February 13, as snow flurries dance in the air, a new idol unit is born at Pythagoras Production. They are the idols who will deliver their kiss to the ends of the galaxy: \"Marginal #4.\" Its members, Atom Kirihara, Rui Aiba, L Nomura, and R Nomura, put all their effort into their entertainment career for the sake of the fan supporting them! They continue to mature as idols along with the senior unit pulling the entertainment industry forward, Lagrange Point, and the younger unit preparing to make their debut, Unicorn Jr. But when they step off the stage, they're ordinary high school boys with some chaotic student lives! This is the tale of Margninal #4, a school slice-of-life about idols that shine brighter than the stars."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"小雪のちらつく2月13日――。ピタゴラスプロダクションから1組のアイドルユニットが誕生した。それは“銀河の果てまでKISSを届けるアイドル・MARGINAL#4”。メンバーの桐原アトム、藍羽ルイ、野村エル、野村アールは応援してくれるファンのため、芸能活動に全力奮闘！ 芸能界を牽引する先輩ユニット・LAGRANGE POINT、デビューを控えた後輩ユニット・UNICORN Jr.とともにアイドルとして成長していく。だけど……？ 1歩ステージを降りれば、彼らも普通の現役高校生！ わちゃわちゃな学園生活はハプニングだらけ！ これはMARGINAL#4が繰り広げていく、星より目映いアイドル＋日常学園ストーリー！ 個性豊かなメンバーが紡ぎ出す“夢”と“絆”。この2つが合わさったとき、奇跡のBig Bangが誕生する――!?","tagline":"銀河級にきらめく青春（ステージ）、Big Bang!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/urhY0sALSGBFtKzqac1Nu0SG8Wg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/urhY0sALSGBFtKzqac1Nu0SG8Wg.jpg","language":"xx","width":500,"height":750}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cf3V6YMhvuxkgZQrUe1rLOZRvjQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cf3V6YMhvuxkgZQrUe1rLOZRvjQ.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/urhY0sALSGBFtKzqac1Nu0SG8Wg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cf3V6YMhvuxkgZQrUe1rLOZRvjQ.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2017,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iG0xGhMs5OkL1wplntnvKH32O24.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69294/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cf3V6YMhvuxkgZQrUe1rLOZRvjQ.jpg"},"episodes":[{"link":"5539","sourcePath":"/play/marginal-4-kiss-kara-tsukuru-big-bang.4igp4/hWgtJ","sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"芸能事務所「ピタゴラスプロダクション」が主催するライブイベント「ユニバースFES」を経て、“銀河の果てまでKISSを届けるアイドル”としてデビューを果たしたMARGINAL#4！ 彼らの目標は、流星館で単独ライブをおこなうこと。アイドルとして